                            <Polygon POINTS="372 2271 372 2287 1315 2287 1315 2271 1313 2236 372 2244 372 2271"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="they will kill us; we are unable to walk any longer.’"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l34" HPOS="473" VPOS="2287" WIDTH="1674" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="475 2312 2147 2318" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="475 2312 473 2328 2143 2334 2147 2318 2145 2293 475 2287 475 2312"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“The older sister took the knife from one of the sleeping men. They went to the snow, cut"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l35" HPOS="372" VPOS="2334" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="46" BASELINE="374 2363 2147 2369" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="374 2363 372 2376 2143 2380 2147 2369 2145 2341 374 2334 374 2363"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="it through with the knife, and dug the ground under it, making a hole like a fox’s burrow. The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l36" HPOS="372" VPOS="2382" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="374 2410 2147 2413" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="374 2410 372 2423 2143 2427 2147 2413 2145 2386 374 2382 374 2410"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="elder sister made the younger go in, then covered her with earth and snow, and effaced all traces"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l37" HPOS="372" VPOS="2427" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="374 2454 2147 2462" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="374 2454 372 2466 2143 2476 2147 2462 2145 2435 374 2427 374 2454"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of her work, as if the snow were quite intact. While working thus, she said, ‘I will go with them."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l38" HPOS="376" VPOS="2468" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="378 2501 2149 2509" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="378 2501 376 2515 2145 2523 2149 2509 2147 2482 378 2468 378 2501"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="You at least, shall return home. While they are here, you must remain quietly in hiding; but"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l39" HPOS="374" VPOS="2521" WIDTH="1775" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="376 2548 2149 2556" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="376 2548 374 2562 2145 2569 2149 2556 2147 2528 376 2521 376 2548"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="when the sun is quite high, and we go away, all three of us, then you may come out and return"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l40" HPOS="372" VPOS="2565" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="374 2595 2149 2602" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="374 2595 372 2606 2145 2614 2149 2602 2147 2575 374 2565 374 2595"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="home. The younger of the brothers wants very strongly to have me for his wife. Let him take"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l41" HPOS="374" VPOS="2610" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="376 2643 2151 2649" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="376 2643 374 2655 2147 2669 2151 2649 2149 2622 1633 2622 1559 2610 1557 2610 376 2614 376 2643"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="me, but you go home.’ She went back to the men, put the knife in its old place; then, lying"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l42" HPOS="372" VPOS="2661" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="374 2688 2149 2694" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="374 2688 372 2702 2145 2712 2149 2694 2147 2667 374 2661 374 2688"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="down, she simulated sleep. When the spring sun began to descend, one of the men awoke, then"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l43" HPOS="374" VPOS="2708" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="376 2735 2151 2739" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="376 2735 374 2747 617 2758 619 2758 2149 2753 2151 2739 2149 2712 376 2708 376 2735"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="another. ‘Oh, dear! where is the other girl? She has fled, and we did not notice it.’ The other"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l44" HPOS="376" VPOS="2754" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="378 2782 2149 2786" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="378 2782 376 2803 2145 2805 2149 2786 2147 2758 378 2754 378 2782"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="girl continues to feign sleep. They try to wake her, but still she sleeps. At last she awakens too."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l45" HPOS="378" VPOS="2797" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="53" BASELINE="379 2825 2151 2834" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="379 2825 378 2838 2147 2850 2151 2834 2149 2807 379 2797 379 2825"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="‘Where is the other? Ah! but she was lying here close by! What have you done with her? You"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l46" HPOS="376" VPOS="2844" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="378 2875 2147 2881" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="378 2875 376 2887 2143 2899 2147 2881 2145 2844 378 2844 378 2875"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="have slept side by side!’ — ‘Oh, but you are men! Why have you not had a look for her? I"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l47" HPOS="378" VPOS="2893" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="379 2920 2151 2928" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="379 2920 378 2932 2147 2942 2151 2928 2149 2901 379 2893 379 2920"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="was so tired, I could not even walk. But why have you slept so soundly?’ The men were silent."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l48" HPOS="378" VPOS="2938" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="50" BASELINE="379 2967 2151 2975" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="379 2967 378 2979 2147 2988 2151 2975 2149 2947 379 2938 379 2967"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Then one said, “Well, let her go where she likes. We will take this one. She is at least in our"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-054_l49" HPOS="376" VPOS="2984" WIDTH="1777" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="378 3014 2153 3021" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="378 3014 376 3027 2149 3035 2153 3021 2151 2994 378 2984 378 3014"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="hands.” — ‘Not yet,’ says the other brother. “Let us look in yonder snow.” The girl’s heart"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
